`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Fly.io runs your apps close to your users. This page explains how our free trial works and what you can use before you add a payment method.`})}),`
`,_jsx(Heading,{level:`2`,id:`free-trial-overview`,children:`Free Trial overview`}),`
`,_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[`New accounts get `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`$1 of free credit`}),`, with no credit card required. You can spend it on Machines, Sprites and Managed Postgres. The credit lasts for 7 days or until you use it up, whichever comes first.`]}),`
`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`That’s enough to deploy a real app or try a few Sprites before you decide if Fly.io is a fit for you.`}),`
`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`The credit applies to your personal organization, the one we create for you at signup.`}),`
`,_jsx(Heading,{level:`2`,id:`trial-limits`,children:`Trial limits`}),`
